BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.levyparkhousto
 n.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/DSC08501.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/wp-content/upload
 s/2024/10/DSC08501.jpg
UID:_2muDLL43p1e_wHTWZIRd
SUMMARY:Houston Museum of Natural Science
DTSTAMP:20260724T105422Z
DTSTART:20260726T140000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Houston Museum of Natural Science comes to Levy Park to off
	er an opportunity to learn firsthand from Museum experts. Encounter real s
	pecimens and artifacts from the museum collection in an intimate\, educati
	onal atmosphere. \nMay 31: Rocks and Minerals \nExplore the fascinating ch
	aracteristics of the most important building blocks of Earth’s crust. \nJu
	ly 26: Energy \nExciting demonstrations explore the remarkable forms of en
	ergy we encounter every day. \nAugust 30: Dinosaur Discovery \nPeek into t
	he thrilling daily life of the dinosaur: investigate what dinosaurs ate\, 
	how they hunted\, and the adaptations they developed to survive in a harsh
	 prehistoric world. \nSeptember 27: Birds \nEncounter an amazing variety o
	f birds and discover their fascinating ancestral roots\, while learning ab
	out their adaptations for success. \nOctober 25: Ancient Egypt \nFrom mumm
	ies to the pyramids\, experience amazing architectural and cultural aspect
	s of Ancient Egypt. \nNovember 29: Little Bodies\, Big Jobs! \nBrings a se
	lection of live arthropods from the Cockrell Butterfly Center to your clas
	sroom. Audiences of all ages will have a unique opportunity to meet some o
	f the hardest workers in the invertebrate world up close and personal. \nD
	ecember 13:  Astronomy  \nInvestigate our place in space and ways we study
	 this exciting place full of planets\, moons\, stars\, and galaxies.\n\nht
	tps://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/houston-museum-of-natural-science/202
	6-07-26/\n\nFrom Levy Park Houston
URL:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/houston-museum-of-natural-scienc
	e/2026-07-26/
LOCATION:Levy Park (Event Pavilion)\, TX
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:levy-park-houston
CATEGORIES:Levy Park Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
